  "question": {
    "text": "In a series LCR circuit, the inductive reactance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> and the capacitive reactance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. The resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>)</mo></math> in the circuit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. The power factor of the circuit is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0103_4352605153c8.png\" style=\"width: 308px; height: 163px;\" /></p><p>We know that power factor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>Z</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0103_6ddb72a8459d.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 187px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
